  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nali&#xbf;Themba: Preventing Violence, Expanding Access to Rights and Bringing Hope to Trans and Gender Diverse Communities in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action responds to the CfP global objective to strengthen capacity of local and national CSOs to engage&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;in gender equality and youth inclusion targeting CBOs and CSOs of minority groups with a SOGIE (sexual&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;orientation, gender identity and expression) perspective at provincial and national levels with youth-oriented&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;actions. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It addresses one of its specific objectives &#xbf;to prevent Gender-Based Violence and femicide in public&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and private spheres&#xbf;, focusing on GBVF of trans and gender diverse people but also supporting, through multisector&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;coordination with the LGBTQI+ and women&#xbf;s rights movements, multi-sector coordinated strategies to&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;prevent all forms of GBVF.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
